    "body": "## Summary\n- add Flyway V55 audit state and nullable terminal route-stop geometry\n- add bounded `FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED` retention cleanup for terminal exact job location\n- purge origin/destination geometry, private labels, route polyline, stop geometry/place IDs and consumed route quotes while preserving public/accounting history\n- delete expired unreferenced route quotes\n- require an explicit production exact-location retention period\n- add focused unit coverage, production Compose contract checks and a real PostgreSQL/PostGIS multi-stop retention smoke\n- document the access, retention, financial and deployment boundaries\n\n## Safety\n- cleanup runs asynchronously outside completion/cancellation money transactions\n- only `DONE`/`CANCELLED` jobs older than the configured cutoff are eligible\n- active and disputed jobs are not purged\n- batch selection is locked and `SKIP LOCKED` for multi-instance safety\n- no wallet/escrow/payment/payout/revenue ledger mutation is part of the purge\n\n## Validation required before merge\n- Maven/API verify\n- frontend tests, dependency audit, lint and production build\n- Production Compose contract\n- full Containers/runtime smoke including PostgreSQL/PostGIS retention verification\n- exact latest-head SHA and up-to-date base verification",
